{"tool_name":"densitoquant","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<blockquote>\n<p>DensitoQuant is a simple and fast, yet effective tool for IHC measurements. It measures the density of immunostain on the digital slides by distributing pixels to negative and 3 grades of positive classes by their RGB values. DensitoQuant is especially suitable for quick TMA evaluation. Analyzing a whole digital slide takes only a couple of minutes.</p>\n</blockquote>","summary":"","value":"<blockquote>\r\n<p>DensitoQuant is a simple and fast, yet effective tool for IHC measurements. It measures the density of immunostain on the digital slides by distributing pixels to negative and 3 grades of positive classes by their RGB values. DensitoQuant is especially suitable for quick TMA evaluation. Analyzing a whole digital slide takes only a couple of minutes.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2020-03-03T11:16:55+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2013-10-11T13:08:43+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4464,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"3cf5b14c-839c-487a-beb9-b284dfe322d0","url":"/taxonomy/term/4464"},{"target_id":4602,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"dd040d9e-87f9-401b-9263-00ac519de9bd","url":"/taxonomy/term/4602"},{"target_id":4555,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"c15752d9-9193-4de3-8ab9-72cb325dd6e5","url":"/taxonomy/term/4555"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505206760,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"The Digital Pathology Company"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":98,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"2ae7ecac-ed23-4375-8a06-79f6a294e65b","url":"/user/98"